><li>F2.0<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara frontal - Autoenfoque<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara frontal - OIS<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara principal - Flash<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara frontal - Flash<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>Resoluci\u00f3n de grabaci\u00f3n de v\u00eddeo<\/li><li>FHD (1920 x 1080)@60fps<\/li><li>Slow Motion<\/li><li>120fps @HD<\/li><li><strong>Almacenamiento\/Memoria<\/strong><\/li><li>Memoria_(GB)<\/li><li>4<\/li><li>Almacenamiento (GB)<\/li><li>128<\/li><li>Soporte de almacenamiento externo<\/li><li>MicroSD (hasta 1TB)<\/li><li><strong>Redes\/Bandas<\/strong><\/li><li>N\u00famero de SIM<\/li><li>Dual-SIM<\/li><li>Tipo de SIM<\/li><li>Nano-SIM (4FF)<\/li><li>Tipo de bandeja de SIM<\/li><li>SIM 1 + SIM 2 + MicroSD<\/li><li>Infra<\/li><li>2G GSM, 3G WCDMA, 4G LTE FDD, 4G LTE TDD<\/li><li>2G GSM<\/li><li>GSM850, GSM900, DCS1800<\/li><li>3G UMTS<\/li><li>B1(2100), B5(850), B8(900)<\/li><li>4G FDD LTE<\/li><li>B1(2100), B3(1800), B5(850), B7(2600), B8(900), B20(800), B28(700)<\/li><li>4G TDD LTE<\/li><li>B38(2600), B40(2300), B41(2500)<\/li><li><strong>Conectividad<\/strong><\/li><li>Interfaz USB<\/li><li>USB Tipo C<\/li><li>Versi\u00f3n USB<\/li><li>USB 2.0<\/li><li>Localizaci\u00f3n<\/li><li>GPS, Glonass, Beidou, Galileo, QZSS<\/li><li>Auriculares<\/li><li>3.5mm Stereo<\/li><li>MHL<\/li><li>No<\/li><li>Wi-Fi<\/li><li>802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac 2.4G+5GHz, VHT80<\/li><li>Wi-Fi Direct<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>Versi\u00f3n Bluetooth<\/li><li>Bluetooth v5.1<\/li><li>NFC<\/li><li>S\u00ed<\/li><li>PC Sync.<\/li><li>Smart Switch (PC version)<\/li><li><strong>Sistema Operativo<\/strong><\/li><li>Android<\/li><li><strong>Informaci\u00f3n general<\/strong><\/li><li>Color<\/li><li>Black<\/li><li>Formato<\/li><li>T\u00e1ctil<\/li><li><strong>Sensores<\/strong><\/li><li>Aceler\u00f3metro, Sensor de huella dactilar, Luminosidad, Sensor de Proximidad<\/li><li><strong>Especificaciones f\u00edsicas<\/strong><\/li><li>Dimensiones (AlxAnxProf, mm)<\/li><li>168.0 x 77.8 x 8